}},{"title":"胡季怀有诗约群从为秋泉之集辄以山果助筵戏作二叠 其一","author":"周必大","text":"近诗通谱江西社，新酿才先天下秋。\n已许眼中窥一豹，可容杯里散千忧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":24455,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"胡季怀惠六出梅一枝仍枉绝句率然次韵勿笑迂拙","author":"周必大","text":"怪底雪花今岁少，东君聚巧入壶春。\n老夫只学龟藏六，未羡梢头首面新。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":24456,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"舣舟清江镇从任子严运使求菊","author":"周必大","text":"陶令思归未得归，黄花想见绕东篱。\n满头须插何容易，且向盘园乞一枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":24457,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"觉报长老道谌写予兄弟真求赞次七兄韵","author":"周必大","text":"身凡心圣古卢能，未著袈裟已是僧。\n冷煖自知师莫问，但看老色几分增。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":24458,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赵倅彦璨写予真求赞","author":"周必大","text":"王父当年此治中，嗟予鬓角未成童。\n只因阖郡攀泥轼，何事偏图鹤发翁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":24459,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送张端明赴召 其九","author":"周必大","text":"公门如海亦如龙，解榻铃斋独见容。\n惭愧深知何以报，岁寒千尺涧边松。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":24460,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送张端明赴召 其十","author":"周必大","text":"欲驱羸马从金鞍，顾藉微官进自难。\n但愿斯民均暖律，小儒不叹广文寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":24461,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送张端明赴召 其七","author":"周必大","text":"尺一催归侍冕旒，邦人无路止前驺。\n却因遥祝南山寿，小作台城十日留。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":24462,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送张端明赴召 其六","author":"周必大","text":"心正能教笔不攲，古来书法独公知。\n颜筋柳骨留萧寺，总是甘棠去后思。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":24463,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送张端明赴召 其一","author":"周必大","text":"春殿曾收最上科，甘泉扈驾早鸣珂。\n金陵已奏三年课，玉烛宜调四气和。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":24464,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送张端明赴召 其八","author":"周必大","text":"延英引对宠章新，都下传观拜辅臣。\n沙路缓驱金騕袅，阁间新上玉麒麟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":24465,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送张端明赴召 其三","author":"周必大","text":"归粟招提刻翠珉，羯胡稽首叹名臣。\n今闻整辔登廊庙，应有先声詟四邻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":24466,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送张端明赴召 其五","author":"周必大","text":"曾以诗书化蜀人，更恢文教